    <node id="&quot;KIDD HOUSE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kidd House, also known as Kidd Residence, is a bungalow house built in 1919 in Lavonia, Georgia, with Craftsman interior details and significant architectural features."</data>
      <data key="d2">ramdocs-0201-5c8cecac2847</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LAVONIA&quot;">
